                                <i class="bi bi-exclamation-triangle-fill text-danger me-2" style="font-size: 16px;"></i>
                                <h6 class="mb-0 fw-bold text-danger" style="font-size: 13px;">ZONA DEGRADASI TIER 3 (Target Ada, Pencapaian 0%)</h6>
