                                                            <span class="badge py-0 px-1" style="background: #ecfdf5; color: #047857; border: 1px solid #a7f3d0; font-size: 9px; font-weight: 700;" title="Total realisasi laporan safety: @emp.totalActualAll laporan. Keaktifan melapor menjadi nilai tambah saat PTS sama.">
                                                                <i class="bi bi-shield-check me-0.5"></i>@emp.totalActualAll Lap
