                                                                            </div>
                                                                            <div class="text-muted text-start mt-1.5" style="font-size: 9px; line-height: 1.35;">
                                                                                <i class="bi bi-people me-1 text-indigo" style="color: #4338ca;"></i>Proporsional murni (@emp.mtdTotalTarget / @emp.maxTargetPlayer &times; 100%): Karyawan dengan target tugas lebih banyak memperoleh poin beban kerja proporsional lebih besar.
                                                                            </div>
                                                                        </div>
                                                                    </div>
                                                                </div>
                                                            </div>

                                                            <!-- Banner Rangkuman Akumulasi PTS -->
                                                            <div class="mt-2.5 p-2 px-3 rounded-2 d-flex flex-wrap align-items-center justify-content-between gap-2" style="background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; font-size: 11px;">
                                                                <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2">
                                                                    <div class="d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center rounded-circle bg-primary-subtle text-primary" style="width: 22px; height: 22px; font-size: 11px; flex-shrink: 0;">
                                                                        <i class="bi bi-info-circle-fill"></i>
                                                                    </div>
                                                                    <div class="text-secondary" style="font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.4;">
                                                                        <strong class="text-dark">Akumulasi Skor PTS:</strong> (@emp.ptsCapaian pts) + (@emp.ptsClose pts) + (@emp.ptsKualitas pts) + (@emp.ptsBeban pts) = <strong class="text-primary fs-6">@emp.totalScore pts (@emp.totalScore%)</strong>
                                                                        <span class="text-muted d-none d-lg-inline ms-2">&bull; Standar penilaian objektif, akuntabel &amp; terverifikasi sistem.</span>
                                                                    </div>
                                                                </div>
                                                            </div>
                                                        </div>
                                                    }
                                                </div>
                                            </td>
                                        </tr>
                                    }
                                }
                            </tbody>
                        </table>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Expansion / Show All Bar -->
                    <div class="p-2 px-3 bg-light border-top d-flex flex-wrap align-items-center justify-content-between gap-2 mb-2" style="font-size: 11px; border-radius: 0 0 8px 8px;">
                        <div class="text-muted">
                            @if (!showAllPlayers && totalPlayerCount > 10)
                            {
                                <span>Menampilkan <strong>Top 10 @(isVolumeMode ? "Pelapor Terbanyak" : "Pemain Terbaik")</strong> dari total <strong>@totalPlayerCount.ToString("N0")</strong> pemain</span>
                            }
                            else
                            {
                                <span>Menampilkan <strong>Seluruh @(displayEmployees != null ? displayEmployees.Count.ToString("N0") : totalPlayerCount.ToString("N0"))</strong> pemain (@(isVolumeMode ? "Urut Laporan Terbanyak" : "Urut Skor PTS"))</span>
                            }
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            @if (!showAllPlayers && totalPlayerCount > 10)
                            {
                                <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-primary py-1 px-3 rounded-pill fw-bold shadow-xs" onclick="toggleShowAllPlayers(true);" style="font-size: 11px;">
                                    <i class="bi bi-arrows-expand me-1"></i>Buka Semua Pemain (@totalPlayerCount.ToString("N0"))
                                </button>
                            }
                            else if (showAllPlayers)
                            {
                                <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary py-1 px-3 rounded-pill fw-semibold" onclick="toggleShowAllPlayers(false);" style="font-size: 11px;">
                                    <i class="bi bi-arrows-collapse me-1"></i>Tampilkan Top 10 Saja
                                </button>
                            }
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="mt-2.5 text-muted px-1" style="font-size: 10.5px; line-height: 1.45; border-top: 1px dashed #e2e8f0; padding-top: 6px;">
                        <div class="d-flex align-items-start gap-1">
                            <i class="bi bi-shield-check me-1 text-success fs-6 mt-0.5"></i>
                            <div>
                                <strong>Syarat Mutlak Kelayakan Juara (Podium):</strong> Pengawas wajib <strong>Tuntas 100% Seluruh Target Program K3</strong> (Capaian 100% / form dots hijau penuh <span class="badge bg-success text-white py-0 px-1" style="font-size: 9px;">W</span> tanpa ada program yang draw/kurang). Pengawas yang kewajiban programnya belum tuntas tidak berhak menempati podium juara.
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="d-flex align-items-start gap-1 mt-1">
                            <i class="bi bi-trophy me-1 text-warning fs-6 mt-0.5"></i>
                            <div>
                                <strong>Penentuan Peringkat Juara:</strong> Di antara pengawas yang tuntas 100%, peringkat ditentukan oleh <strong>Skor PTS 4 Pilar</strong> tertinggi. Jika skor PTS sama, <strong>keaktifan kuantitas laporan safety riil</strong> (<span class="badge py-0 px-1" style="background: #ecfdf5; color: #047857; border: 1px solid #a7f3d0; font-size: 9px; font-weight: 700;">Lap</span>) menjadi nilai tambah apresiasi.
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

